{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Cap food delivery platform commissions at 20% including VAT",
        "additional_details": "Independent restaurants and takeaways face soaring costs while delivery platforms can charge commissions of 30\u201335% plus VAT. These fees squeeze businesses, threaten jobs and put pressure on food prices. We urge the Government to act now: introduce a legally enforceable 20% cap on all mandatory delivery-platform fees, including VAT, protect independent businesses from excessive charges and ensure a fairer, more transparent food delivery industry across the UK.",
        "background": "Introduce a 20% inclusive-of-VAT cap on total fees charged to UK food businesses by delivery platforms using their own drivers, covering commissions, service, processing, technology and mandatory delivery-related fees. Prohibit additional compulsory charges that bypass the cap.",
